-        $$ C = \sum_{i \in N} c_i \alpha_i \prod_{j < i} (1 - \alpha_j) $$
-        where $c_i$ is the view-dependent color and $\alpha_i$ is the opacity of Gaussian $i$ [S1][S6, unofficial].
